  "idea": "Automated weekly backup system for store assets and customer records",
  "text": "Here is how smart entrepreneurs de-risk their side hustle business against sudden platform bans. Operating without an independent customer database leaves your hard-earned revenue exposed to third-party volatility. If a marketplace closes your storefront, reconnecting with past buyers to restart sales becomes impossible. Build an automated workflow syncing Stripe customer data and digital download files directly into Notion. You will maintain total control over your business assets.",
